   "explain": {
    "en": {
     "text": "Marginal cost, revenue and profit are the derivatives C′(x), R′(x), P′(x). Profit P = R − C, and revenue R = (number sold) × (price). The best level is where the marginal function is 0; a sign change from + to − confirms a maximum."
    },
    "am": {
     "text": "የህዳግ ወጪ፣ ገቢና ትርፍ C′(x), R′(x), P′(x) ናቸው። ትርፍ P = R − C፤ ገቢ = ብዛት × ዋጋ። ምርጡ ደረጃ የህዳግ ፋንክሽኑ 0 የሆነበት ነው።",
     "machine": true
    }
   },
